{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"a2eaf3015626c3a6cef0da798937bbf256e46f5d2fb3bbee57bc89960c947b34","ja":"許せない記事","zh":"无法原谅的报道","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"02780ad1ce068d17c91f6e1f4d999bb23d550376d6a62d9e31862a38a0718361","ja":"あっ、恵美ちゃ……。","zh":"啊，小惠美……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"10b8720374d611c0e7fec2813db34d7bbdf51bd884b75aca96957f9d0eda2e6e","ja":"はぁ～……。\nもう！　どうしてこんなこと書くかな～……。","zh":"唉～……。\n真是的！干吗要写这种东西啊～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"307ddb8597dee16894783bf50d9afd6b42d015ddf18531479f14f3bc02c7b0cd","ja":"ど、どうしたんですか、恵美ちゃん！\n悩みがあるなら、遠慮なくありさに言ってください！","zh":"怎、怎么了，惠美姐！\n要是有烦恼，就尽管告诉亚利沙吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4c84923cf7abe30b87fe6a16567ab205b9926e06fba03513ea260d8d749922c9","ja":"あっ、亜利沙。それがさ～、この雑誌を読んでたら、\nなんか落ち込んじゃって……。","zh":"啊，亚利沙。是这样的～我读这本杂志时，\n不知怎么就有点消沉了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b8aa2989d7c97b833ad8cf019550fd14e31f4baf234d2d79f3726c8b3ae7ab55","ja":"これって……あることないことばっかり書いてる、\nゴシップ週刊誌ですよね？","zh":"这就是……尽写些有的没的、\n八卦周刊，对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0793a06827c0f0ca4b620fe41fd81bcf0c62ddad1c38b6dbf8f2efafb2f59b60","ja":"そうなの！　友達に、劇場の記事が載ってるって\n教えてもらって、読んでみたんだけど……。","zh":"是啊！朋友告诉我上面有剧场的报道，  \n我就试着读了读，可是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"71526612cca6eeb5691647706b39e95e49ae908692a07c8951ea478cffa52bd4","ja":"そしたらもう、ほんっとうにひどくって！","zh":"结果，真的太过分了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ef4e8964ce072d7522e556d1a5f2fe8c591dfcbf5ca5cd602d9be44c0e303e03","ja":"なるほど……すみません、\nちょっと読ませてもらいます！　ふむふむ……。","zh":"我明白了……不好意思，\n让我看一下！嗯嗯……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4e6c67d84e39c73e4bed996e2ce7376032a30a9cdce88724390f701098d3fb34","ja":"なんですかこれ！　『あのアイドルたちが不仲』とか、\n『熱愛発覚！』とか『実力を偽るアイドル』とか……。","zh":"这都是什么啊！“那些偶像关系不和”啊、\n“恋情曝光！”啊、“虚报实力的偶像”啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4ce78f595bc26f611e47795983059da2a0513d7a633fa4eebe1d7aa50deacb5f","ja":"絶対にありえませんっ！！","zh":"绝对不可能！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ecc6097ab8765ab58543ac26f36b62c76a275ee92007928ee8dda147bfdb828b","ja":"だよね！　こんな記事を書くなんてって、\n悲しくなっちゃって……。","zh":"对吧！想到居然有人写这种报道，\n就觉得好难过……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"06c686e7082115413a93fa5a6f80a001c22c4b800c147d29b8134d0b84814927","ja":"まったく、こんなものを世に出すなんて、\nアイドルちゃんたちの真摯さへの侮辱と冒涜です！","zh":"真是的，竟然把这种东西公之于众，\n简直是对偶像们真诚态度的侮辱与亵渎！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"76e15084ed3cb8c5b6202c6d96148d18c9f210165896564927790a7d5ebc2f4a","ja":"ねえ、亜利沙！　この記事がでたらめだって、\nなんとかして、みんなに発信しようよ！","zh":"嘿，亚利沙！这篇文章是胡说八道\n我们得想办法让大家都知道","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"109094ca31ef609ab36b1c28ed0e852e48a2c6467ec1ba8f2853d85d56024c0e","ja":"記事の内容が本当かもって思われたら、\nアタシの気が済まないよ！","zh":"如果大家觉得这篇文章的内容可能是真的，\n我就没法心安了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a2c2dd55d41f5bb508ab1601cca2d85ae2166457a62ad579ad52f52cc725e481","ja":"でしたら、ありさたちで\n雑誌を作るのはどうでしょう？","zh":"那就由亚利沙我们来\n制作一本杂志如何？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"cb6319f268a9202b4691aef9a827e7a6244aa0a29f949489191ca57986fb31f4","ja":"ゴシップ週刊誌のウソを暴く記事を書くんです！","zh":"写一篇揭露八卦周刊谎言的报道！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a43b27a0e31759a80428d56ae334eb087c1a133889819febd9272b6f8a374b53","ja":"それいいかも！\nでも雑誌って、個人で出版できるんだっけ？","zh":"这个主意不错！\n但杂志能由个人出版吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1819.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4b9cf4dbba7e8662dd640df60d3e9d88c0e06e1bf415399a6eb5e88eafdf85e6","ja":"でしたら、ネットで公開しちゃいましょう！\nその方が、たくさんの人に見てもらえますから！","zh":"那就直接放到网上公开吧！\n那样能让更多人看到哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
